    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="84.4a">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IICn">II Cn</ref> 84.4a</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">And ælc ðe gescead wite, hlyste him georne ⁊ godcunde lare gewha on geðance healde swyðe fæste him sylfum to ðearfe.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And everyone who has discernment shall earnestly give heed to them, and everyone for his own well-being shall keep fast in his mind their spiritual instruction.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">⁊ ælc þe gescead wite, hlyste him georne, ⁊ godcunde lare gehwa on geþance healde swyðe fæste, him sylfum to þearfe.</ab>
      </div>
